  "description": "Bergamont Vitess bikes are fun and easy to ride. They feature an upright riding position for maximum comfort and control while retaining a sportive look.\n\nThe Vitess 20 model features a lightweight rigid aluminum fork and seat post to save weight. The 8-speed internal gear hub combined with a belt drive require very little maintenance. The puncture resistant Schwalbe Marathon Performance tires and hydraulic disc brakes by Shimano cater to a safe and reliable ride.\n\nErgonomic contact points are key to match your bike to your optimal seating position. City and Trekking saddles in different widths, an adjustable stem and ergonomically shaped bars and lock-on grips ensure a perfect fit.\n\nVisibility is especially important if you cycle every day. Therefore, all Vitess models are equipped with LED front and rear lights. A standlight function and a hub dynamo are, of course, standard. Rounding off the package are multiple mounting points across the frame to securely fasten accessories like a bottle, tools or a lock.",
